// 1712
[struct_1712]
param=param_1266,Climb the Wall
param=param_1273,You must get past the dragon.<br><br>Take some drugged meat from Sir Vant's bag, then find a way to climb over the broken wall near Sir Vant into the main room of the cellar.<br><br>For more information on this Task, click on the Hints tab above.
param=param_1292,Completing this Task will help you escape from the cellar in which you find yourself.
param=param_1271,"task_tutorial_icons2,3"
param=param_1293,63
param=param_1268,3507
param=param_1267,60
param=param_1274,Pick up some drugged meat from Sir Vant's bag by clicking on it.
param=param_1282,0_99_99_0_39
param=param_1275,The wall is too high to climb without aid.
param=param_1276,There is a plank next to the wall; click on it to pick it up.
param=param_1284,0_99_99_0_37
param=param_1269,3523
param=param_1290,1

// 1713
[struct_1713]
param=param_1266,Make a Ramp
param=param_1273,The wall is too high to climb without aid. Click on the plank in your inventory to select it, then on the wall to construct a ramp.<br><br>For more information on this Task, click on the Hints tab above.
param=param_1292,Completing this Task will help you escape from the cellar in which you find yourself.
param=param_1271,"task_tutorial_icons2,3"
param=param_1293,63
param=param_1268,3523
param=param_1267,60
param=param_1274,In your inventory, click on the plank to select it (or right-click and select 'Use').
param=param_1282,0_99_99_0_1
param=param_1275,With the plank selected, click on the low wall to place it. Once you have placed the plank down, you will be able to climb the wall by clicking on it.
param=param_1283,0_99_99_0_38
param=param_1269,3510
param=param_1290,1

// 1714
[struct_1714]
param=param_1266,Put the Dragon to Sleep
